 bidding, forming matched pairs of pumping and generation trades.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"Independent Energy Storage Power Station (独立储能电站)\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Entities participating in inter-provincial electricity trading with dual roles (wholesale user when charging, generator when discharging), prioritizing provincial balance and renewable integration.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"Beijing Electricity Trading Center Market Trading Department Six (京交六部)\"<|>\"Northwest Regional Division Dispatch Control Center (国网西北分部调度控制中心)\"<|>\"京交六部 submits pre-trade results to the dispatch center for safety review, and both collaborate to handle objections.\"<|>\"transaction coordination, safety compliance\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"Safety Review (安全校核)\"<|>\"Monthly Trading (月度交易)\"<|>\"Safety reviews are mandatory for monthly trading results to ensure grid security before finalization.\"<|>\"regulatory compliance, process integration\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"Green Electricity Trading (绿电交易)\"<|>\"Contract Transfer Transaction (合同转让交易)\"<|>\"Green electricity contracts allow flexible adjustments, including transfers, while ensuring environmental value traceability.\"<|>\"value traceability, contract flexibility\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"Pumped Storage Power Station (抽水蓄能电站)\"<|>\"Intra-month Trading (月内交易)\"<|>\"Pumped storage stations participate in intra-month surplus electricity trading when additional capacity is available.\"<|>\"resource utilization, market flexibility\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"Independent Energy Storage Power Station (独立储能电站)\"<|>\"Electricity Market\"<|>\"Independent storage stations participate in medium- and long-term inter-provincial trading as dual-role entities.\"<|>\"market participation, dual roles\"<|>8)##\n(\"content_keywords\"<|>\"electricity trading procedures, grid safety compliance, renewable energy integration, contract flexibility, market regulation\")<|COMPLETE|>"
