lation of metering devices, electricity quantity calculation methods, and settlement procedures for market participants.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"经营主体\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Market Participants include entities that engage in electricity trading, sign contracts, participate in settlement verification, and may raise objections to transaction results.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"绿电交易\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Green Electricity Trading involves separate settlement of energy value and environmental value, with traceability relationships formed from transaction contracts.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"京交六部\"<|>\"省级交易机构\"<|>\"Beijing Electricity Exchange Six Departments organizes provincial trading institutions to jointly conduct transaction clearing verification.\"<|>\"organizational coordination, verification process\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"网调\"<|>\"电力调度机构\"<|>\"Grid Dispatch organizes power dispatching agencies to jointly conduct grid security verification.\"<|>\"administrative oversight, safety management\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"京交六部\"<|>\"电力调度机构\"<|>\"Beijing Electricity Exchange Six Departments submits preliminary transaction results to power dispatching agencies for grid security verification.\"<|>\"process coordination, safety compliance\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"交易校核\"<|>\"电网安全校核\"<|>\"Transaction verification includes grid security verification as an essential component to ensure system safety.\"<|>\"process inclusion, safety assurance\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"绿电交易\"<|>\"京交六部\"<|>\"Beijing Electricity Exchange Six Department forms green electricity traceability relationships based on transaction contracts.\"<|>\"contract implementation, traceability management\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"西北区域\"<|>\"京交六部\"<|>\"Beijing Electricity Exchange Six Department aggregates cross-provincial contracts to form medium-to-long-term transaction plans for the Northwest Region.\"<|>\"regional planning, transaction aggregation\"<|>8)##\n(\"content_keywords\"<|>\"electricity market, transaction verification, grid security, contract management, settlement procedures\")<|COMPLETE|>"
